Key Features Implemented :

World Class
Card Management: Add (arrive) and remove (leave) cards.
Capacity Management: Check if the world is full.
Card Search: Find a card by ID or check if a card is on the world.
Points Conversion: Convert points to bitcoins for all cards.
toString: Display details about the world and the cards on it.
Shuttle Class
Card Validation: canEnterShuttle ensures all conditions (luxury rating, capacity, bitcoins, etc.) are met.
Movement Handling: processCardMovement moves a card and updates its status or returns an error message.
toString: Summarizes the shuttle's journey details.


Next Steps
Test Cases: Implement a tester class to validate the functionality of World and Shuttle classes.
Integration: Connect these classes with a Resort class to manage the system as a whole.
